  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: All\nDescription of the bug: \nThe VRCSDK requires users to log in directly using their username and password. This is terrible opsec practise and considered a security vulnerability. Users have no way of verifying that the origin of the log in request leaving it far too easy to phish account details using a malicious SDK distribution. This flow signifies to users that the normal procedure is to enter their account details into any tool which asks for them and frankly I am amazed that this has not become an issue already.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): \nInstall VRCSDK, open it\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): n/a",
